      "zone": "the_glasswaste",
      "level_min": 16,
      "level_max": 18,
      "elite": false,
      "description": "Whatever burned this canyon didn't stop. It's still up on the rise to the east, walking about on its own, and every time one of them comes down the sand goes to glass under it and my camp gets smaller.\n\nKiln-walkers, I call them. Put out eight and I'll get a season's peace.",
